{
  "meta": {
    "id": "windows-process",
    "name": "Windows 进程行为（0707 抽取）",
    "version": "1.1",
    "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T17:15:00",
    "source": "D:\\\\GeRen\\\\AI\\\\0707\\\\processes",
    "description": "从原 Go 检测器抽取、快照可判定的高价值进程规则。不覆盖内存注入 / 模块扫描 / API 挂钩。",
    "judgment": [
      "不要单靠未签名定罪。0707 要求未签名再叠加脏路径（Public/Temp/Downloads）、投放结构或同目录未签名文件。",
      "未签名文件（同目录）：宿主已签名，且仅在宿主同目录（不含子目录）加载了明确未签名的 .exe/.dll/.sys；系统目录一律不计。",
      "系统进程名必须落在 System32/SysWOW64（explorer 例外，应在 C:\\\\Windows\\\\explorer.exe）。同名跑在用户目录 = 伪装。",
      "LOLBin 不能只报进程名。必须叠加远程 URL、javascript:/vbscript:、编码命令、用户目录脚本、XSL/远程创建等。",
      "PowerShell 单条 -w hidden / -ep bypass 不够。优先 EncodedCommand、IEX、DownloadString、AMSI 绕过组合；-nop + hidden 组合可报。",
      "父子关系只取低误报对：Office→脚本解释器；svchost/services/spoolsv/lsass 期望父进程；services/wininit→LOLBin。explorer→cmd 太常见，不报。",
      "攻击工具名（mimikatz/rubeus/nanodump/chisel 等）和 Mimikatz 模块命令（sekurlsa::）几乎不存在于正常环境。",
      "开源 C2 只报组合特征（OnionC2/GoClip/Havoc 参数/Adaptix/HardHat），不单靠 sleep/checkin。",
      "内存侧（VirtualAllocEx、CobaltStrike beacon 内存、syscall stub）本包不做：采集快照没有这些字段。命名管道字符串可报。"
    ],
    "skipped": [
      "processInjectionAPIs / memory/*",
      "RMM 仅进程名（见 remote_tools.json）",
      "命令行 ArgFuscator 混淆打分",
      "WMIC 信息收集（os get / process get）",
      "UAC 绕过仅进程名（fodhelper/eventvwr 等，无额外证据时误报高）",
      "Token 提权对比（需实时句柄，快照不可用）",
      "白加黑投放包目录枚举评分（已有 sideload 模块规则覆盖核心）"
    ]
  },
  "processRules": [
    {
      "id": "proc.unsigned.public",
      "name": "未签名进程位于 Users\\Public",
      "severity": "critical",
      "enabled": true,
      "requireUnsigned": true,
      "pathContainsAny": ["\\users\\public"],
      "pathNotContainsAny": ["\\windowsapps\\"],
      "reason": "Public 是投放落点；未签名可执行文件在此几乎都是恶意。",
      "source": "0707.CheckProcessPath/CheckDigitalSignature",
      "mitre": ["T1036", "T1204.002"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.sideload.unsigned_module",
      "name": "同目录未签名文件",
      "severity": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "requireHostSigned": true,
      "requireUnsignedModule": true,
      "moduleRequireExplicitUnsigned": true,
      "moduleExtAny": ["dll", "sys", "ocx"],
      "moduleSameDirOnly": true,
      "moduleExcludeSystemPaths": true,
      "moduleRequireLoaded": true,
      "moduleMaxUnsignedSameDir": 1,
      "moduleMaxDirFiles": 40,
      "moduleLargeDirMinUnsigned": 3,
      "moduleLargeDirMinUnsignedRatio": 0.02,
      "moduleMinSignedPeers": 8,
      "reason": "已签名宿主实际加载了同目录恰好 1 个明确未签 dll/sys/ocx 才报（必须有 modules 加载证据，不以磁盘旁落定罪）。同目录未签 DLL≥2（已加载或磁盘）不报；大目录/已签同伴很多的厂商树也不报。",
      "source": "custom.sideload",
      "mitre": ["T1574.002", "T1574.001"],
      "fpRisk": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.sideload.cross_dir_unsigned_module",
      "name": "跨目录未签名模块",
      "severity": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "requireHostSigned": true,
      "requireUnsignedModule": true,
      "moduleRequireExplicitUnsigned": true,
      "moduleExtAny": ["dll", "sys", "ocx"],
      "moduleSameDirOnly": false,
      "moduleCrossDirOnly": true,
      "moduleExcludeSystemPaths": true,
      "moduleMaxDirFiles": 8,
      "moduleMaxUnsignedSameDir": 1,
      "reason": "已签名宿主 exe 加载了「其它目录」里明确未签名的 dll/sys/ocx，且该目录文件很少——典型是投放一个孤立 DLL 后由白程序拉起（白加黑跨目录变体）。同目录多个未签 DLL 不定罪；同目录场景由 proc.sideload.unsigned_module 覆盖。",
      "source": "custom.sideload",
      "mitre": ["T1574.002", "T1574.001"],
      "fpRisk": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.unsigned.temp",
      "name": "未签名进程位于 Temp",
      "severity": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "requireUnsigned": true,
      "pathContainsAny": ["\\temp\\", "\\tmp\\", "\\appdata\\local\\temp\\", "\\appdata\\roaming\\temp\\"],
      "pathNotContainsAny": ["\\windowsapps\\", "go-build"],
      "reason": "未签名 + Temp/Tmp 是 0707 的 critical dirty path。",
      "source": "0707.CheckDigitalSignature",
      "mitre": ["T1036.005", "T1204.002"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.path.inetpub_exe",
      "name": "IIS 目录下的可执行进程",
      "severity": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "pathContainsAny": ["\\inetpub\\"],
      "reason": "Web 根目录跑 exe/脚本常为 webshell 落地后的执行。",
      "source": "0707.CheckProcessPath",
      "mitre": ["T1505.003"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.path.appdata_local_root",
      "name": "AppData\\Local 根目录可执行文件",
      "severity": "medium",
      "enabled": true,
      "pathRegex": "^[a-z]:\\\\users\\\\[^\\\\]+\\\\appdata\\\\local\\\\[^\\\\]+$",
      "reason": "直接落在 Local 根下、没有厂商子目录，常见投放形态。",
      "source": "0707.CheckProcessPath",
      "mitre": ["T1036.005"],
      "fpRisk": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.path.templates_exe",
      "name": "Windows 模板目录下的可执行文件",
      "severity": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "pathContainsAny": ["\\appdata\\roaming\\microsoft\\windows\\templates\\"],
      "reason": "模板目录不是正常程序安装位置。",
      "source": "0707.CheckSuspiciousFilePath",
      "mitre": ["T1036.005"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.path.temp_cfg_drop",
      "name": "Temp 下 .cfg/GUID 目录投放可执行文件",
      "severity": "critical",
      "enabled": true,
      "pathRegex": "(?i)\\\\temp\\\\([^\\\\]+\\.cfg|[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f-]{20,}|[0-9a-f~]{6,}\\.cfg)\\\\[^\\\\]+\\.(exe|dll|scr)$",
      "reason": "AppData\\Local\\Temp 下以 .cfg 或 GUID 目录投放的 exe（常见银狐/代理马包装；冰盾拦截 WP 计划任务写注册表后，进程侧仍应告警）",
      "source": "custom.temp_cfg_drop",
      "mitre": ["T1055", "T1036.005", "T1546"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.unsigned.programdata_root",
      "name": "未签名进程位于 ProgramData 根目录",
      "severity": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "requireUnsigned": true,
      "pathImmediateUnder": ["C:\\ProgramData"],
      "reason": "ProgramData 根下落独立 exe 属于投放，大安装树不报。",
      "source": "0707.CheckProcessPath",
      "mitre": ["T1036.005"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.masquerade.system_bin",
      "name": "系统进程名不在 System32/SysWOW64",
      "severity": "critical",
      "enabled": true,
      "nameEqualsAny": [
        "svchost.exe", "lsass.exe", "services.exe", "csrss.exe", "smss.exe",
        "wininit.exe", "winlogon.exe", "rundll32.exe", "regsvr32.exe", "msiexec.exe"
      ],
      "pathNotContainsAny": ["\\windows\\system32\\", "\\windows\\syswow64\\"],
      "reason": "系统关键进程必须来自系统目录；用户目录同名 = 伪装/傀儡。",
      "source": "0707.CheckSystemProcessUserPath/CheckSvchostAnomaly/CheckDigitalSignature",
      "mitre": ["T1036.005"],
      "fpRisk": "low"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc.masquerade.explorer",
